<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coles Myer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coles Myer cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Coles Myer Ltd to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
